5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! Let's pick a place where we can all have a blast! I want to make sure the costs are fair for everyone this time.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely to see you all. I hope we can choose a destination that brings our members closer together and fosters a warm atmosphere.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We should be cautious. We need a plan that is sustainable and doesn't place an undue burden on the organizers.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm so excited! I want to go somewhere adventurous, but we have to make sure we actually get some sleep so we can train hard!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree we need to be careful. We must ensure the budget is precise before we announce any fees to the membership.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, what do you mean by ""burden""? I'll check the ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets"" and ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" to see about the money!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I believe the social aspect is key. I will look into ""What the seniors say about year-groups mixing"" and ""Attendance sheets for the away camps.""","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I am referring to the workload. I'll investigate the ""Lottery and application for public group bookings"" and ""Canteen closure and last year's cooking duty.""","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to know about the beds! I'll check the ""Accounts from two clubs that went inland"" and ""Prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds""!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I will focus on the financial risks. I'll look into ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets.""","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
