18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Misaki, do you think the transport costs are the biggest problem? I hope we can find a place that's both cheap and comfy!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,It is often the most volatile expense. We need to see the actual receipts to avoid another deficit.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
