35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, I found out that transport is a huge part of the cost! Also, those whole-building lets can be risky if people drop out late.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I discovered that the evenings are when the real bonding happens, but sadly, some members have stopped coming to the away camps entirely.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The administrative side is a nightmare. Public bookings require a tedious lottery and a nine-page application that is very rigid.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The public beds are cheap, but I read that some clubs had eight people to a room with a strict eleven o'clock lights-out! That sounds exhausting!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"My findings confirm Mio's. Transport costs vary wildly depending on distance, and non-refundable deposits for buildings create a financial gap if attendance drops.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, if the deposits are non-refundable, we might be paying for people who aren't even there! That's so unfair.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, if the rooms are too crowded, people might feel stressed rather than connected. We need a place where everyone feels welcome.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, the ""unfairness"" of the cost is secondary to the labor. I also found that cooking for ourselves takes hours away from training.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, hours of cooking sounds like a lot of work! But eight people in one room sounds like a slumber party... except we'd be too tired to move!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,We cannot afford a system where the club account covers the gaps. We need a destination that minimizes transport and financial risk.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if we find a place with a canteen or a lodge that provides meals, we can save you from all that cooking work!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"That would be wonderful. If the organizers aren't exhausted by chores, they can help the younger members mingle more.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"A place with provided meals would be a significant improvement. However, we must weigh that against the booking complexity.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I just want to make sure we don't end up in a place where we can't sleep! If we're tired, the whole camp is ruined.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"Provided meals and a fixed cost would be ideal, but we must be wary of the ""whole-building"" deposit risks Mio mentioned.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
