60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Okay, the options are Campus Intensive, Mountain Training Centre, or Coastal Lodge. I'm worried about the Coastal Lodge's non-refundable deposits.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The Campus option seems convenient, but I worry it won't encourage the members to bond if they just go home.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,The Mountain Centre has that terrible lottery and application process. I cannot imagine spending my evenings filling out nine pages of forms.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,"The Mountain Centre sounds like the ""eight people to a room"" place! I don't want to be forced to sleep at eleven if we're having fun!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Campus is the safest financially since transport is minimal, but the Coastal Lodge is the only one with provided meals to reduce labor.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, but if we go to the Coast, and someone cancels, the rest of us pay! I can't support that risk. I vote for Campus Intensive.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"If we want the year-groups to mix, we need to stay together. The Mountain Centre or Coastal Lodge are better for that. I vote Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,I refuse to deal with the public booking lottery or the cooking duties of the campus. The Coastal Lodge is the most efficient for the staff. I vote Coastal Lodge.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,I don't want the Mountain Centre's strict rules! The Coast sounds like a real adventure and we can actually sleep in a lodge! I vote Coastal Lodge.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"While the deposit is a risk, the transport costs for the Coast are high. However, Campus is too risky for the budget if we have to pay for beds. I vote Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"Wait, everyone is voting for the Coast? But the money! If we just stay on campus, it's so much simpler!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, simplicity isn't everything. The heart of the club is the friendship we build. The Coast offers that.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, the labor cost of the campus option is too high. We need a professional setup.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,"Come on, Mio! A seaside lodge sounds way more fun than staying at school!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"The consensus seems to be that the social and labor benefits of the Lodge outweigh the financial risks, provided we manage the headcount.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,"I still hate the idea of paying for someone else's spot, but I don't want to be the only one left out. I'll change my vote to Coastal Lodge!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am so glad we could agree on a place that prioritizes our togetherness. I vote Coastal Lodge.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,It is the only rational choice to avoid administrative burnout. I vote Coastal Lodge.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Rin,,Yay! Seaside adventure! I vote Coastal Lodge!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"For the sake of the organizers and the social health of the club, I vote Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
